%rec: experience
# ExpLvls: the experience total each character level needs, level 1 first. Ten per line.
# Also a design choice - H&H had no experience ladder. This one is 1500 * (1.3^n - 1), rounded to ten, which
# gives 50 levels ending near 7.5e8. Tune it against how much experience this mod's monsters actually pay.

